        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=answer the user query:  {{ $json.message.text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "CRITICAL INSTRUCTION: You MUST use search tools to find current information.\n\nSTEP 1 - DETERMINE CURRENT DATE:\n- Use SERP API to search: \"current date today\"\n- Extract and confirm today's date\n- Store as: detected_date\n\nSTEP 2 - SEARCH FOR RECENT NEWS (MANDATORY):\nYou MUST call these tools with date restrictions:\n\nA) SERP API Tool:\n   Query format: \"latest [topic] news December 2025\"\n   Add these parameters if available:\n   - tbs: \"qdr:m\" (last month)\n   - dateRestrict: \"m1\"\n   \nB) Perplexity Tool:\n   Query: \"What are the latest scientific breakthroughs in December 2025? Only show results from the past 30 days.\"\n\nC) If tools don't return December 2025 results:\n   - Try different search terms\n   - Add \"December 2025\" explicitly to queries\n   - Verify publication dates in results\n\nSTEP 3 - VALIDATE RESULTS:\nBefore outputting:\n- Check EVERY news item has a date from December 2025\n- If you see April 2024 or any old dates, those are from your training data\n- REJECT training data, ONLY use fresh search results\n- If no December 2025 results found, output: \"Unable to find recent news\"\n\nCRITICAL VALIDATION:\n- If your output contains \"April 2024\" = YOU FAILED\n- If your output contains any 2024 dates = YOU FAILED\n- ONLY dates from December 2025 are acceptable\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n{\n  \"detected_date\": \"[Current date from search]\",\n  \"short_summary\": \"Latest news from December 2025: [summary]\",\n  \"full_newsletter\": \"<b>📰 Science News - December 26, 2025</b>\\n\\n[Only December 2025 content]\",\n  \"image_search\": \"science-news-december-2025\"\n}\n\nFINAL CHECK: Does your newsletter contain ONLY December 2025 dates? If NO, start over."
        }
      },
